      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNGLE BOOGIE (1) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 1/2 at Launceston over 515m. Look for sharp improvement here. TWO GIRLS (4) hit the ground running to win over the 340m at this track two runs back then settled forward again when finishing third at this track last start. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. WELLINGTON ROSES (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (16.32) at Launceston behind Canya Lexi in a Grade 4. Has the pace to be prominent. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Expected to feature. WORPEL (3) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot in a fast run most recently.",
